{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1484","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"树：种植。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10002-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"实五石：能容得下五石的东西。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10002-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"坚：坚固。这里指大瓠的坚固程度。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10002-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"瓠 huò落无所容：宽大而没有什么可盛受的东西。瓠落，宽大空廓的样子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10002-4"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"呺（xiāo）然：内中空虚而宽大的样子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10002-5"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"掊（pǒu）：击破。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10002-6"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"拙于用大：不善于使用大的东西，不善于发挥事物的“大”的功用。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10002-7"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"不龟（jūn）手之药：防止手冻裂的药物。龟，同“皲”，皮肤冻裂。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10002-8"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"洴（pínɡ） 澼（pì）：漂洗丝絮。𬘢，同“纩”，丝绵絮。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10002-9"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"鬻（yù）：卖。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10002-10"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"说（shuì）：劝说别人听从自己的意见。一说，同“悦”，取悦。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10002-11"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"越有难（nàn）：指越人发兵侵吴。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10002-12"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"虑：用绳结缀。一说，考虑。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10002-13"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"樽：盛酒器。这是说大瓠像大樽，缚于身，可使人漂浮渡水。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10002-14"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"蓬之心：比喻不通达的见识。蓬，一种草，弯曲不直。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10002-15"}],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"惠子谓庄子曰：“魏王贻我大瓠之种，我树","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-10002-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"之成而实五石","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-10002-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。以盛水浆，其坚","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-10002-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"不能自举也。剖之以为瓢，则瓠落无所容","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-10002-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。非不呺然","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-10002-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"大也，吾为其无用而掊","type":"text"},{"label":"[6]","noteId":"footnote-10002-6","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"之。”庄子曰：“夫子固拙于用大","type":"text"},{"label":"[7]","noteId":"footnote-10002-7","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"矣。宋人有善为不龟手之药","type":"text"},{"label":"[8]","noteId":"footnote-10002-8","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"者，世世以洴澼𬘢","type":"text"},{"label":"[9]","noteId":"footnote-10002-9","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"为事。客闻之，请买其方百金。聚族而谋之曰：‘我世世为洴澼𬘢，不过数金。今一朝而鬻","type":"text"},{"label":"[10]","noteId":"footnote-10002-10","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"技百金，请与之。’客得之，以说","type":"text"},{"label":"[11]","noteId":"footnote-10002-11","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"吴王。越有难","type":"text"},{"label":"[12]","noteId":"footnote-10002-12","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，吴王使之将。冬，与越人水战，大败越人，裂地而封之。能不龟手一也，或以封，或不免于洴澼𬘢，则所用之异也。今子有五石之瓠，何不虑","type":"text"},{"label":"[13]","noteId":"footnote-10002-13","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"以为大樽","type":"text"},{"label":"[14]","noteId":"footnote-10002-14","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"而浮乎江湖，而忧其瓠落无所容？则夫子犹有蓬之心","type":"text"},{"label":"[15]","noteId":"footnote-10002-15","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"也夫！”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"孔子开创了儒家学派，老子则开创了道家学派。老子之后，道家代表人物又有庄子等人。《老子》《庄子》中的思想常有突破俗见之处，可以说是见人所不见，知人所不知，想人所不能想，言人所不能言。学习本课，首先就要留意《老子》《庄子》的这些篇章有哪些突破常规的认识。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"学者柳诒征指出：“老子之书，专说对待之理。”（《中国文化史》）本课所选《老子》四章中的“有”和“无”，“知人”和“自知”，“胜人”和“自胜”，就是“对待”关系。通常情况下，人们偏执于这种对待关系的一面，比如“有”“知人”“胜人”等。可《老子》却总是提醒世人重视那通常被忽视的一面，其论说有很强的思辨性，对现实人生有一定的启示。阅读时，可以把课文中类似的关系提取出来，看看《老子》重视的是什么，有没有道理。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"庄子也善于从常人认为没有价值的事物中发现价值。在《五石之瓠》中，惠子仅从日常使用的层面上考虑大葫芦的功用，庄子则超越了世俗经验的束缚，指出了大葫芦的独特价值。这个寓意深刻的小故事，表现出庄子与众不同的思维方式，阅读时注意体会。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"从表达技巧上来说，《老子》善于汲取世俗经验展开哲理思辨，直接论说道理；《庄子》则长于借助寓言，婉曲达意，以增强说理的趣味和效果。学习本课，要注意在比较中品味二者不同的论述风格和语言韵味。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"背诵《〈老子〉四章》。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"frontMatter":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"节选自《庄子·逍遥游》（《庄子集释》，中华书局2004 年版）。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"题目是编者加的。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"石，计算容量的单位，十斗为一石。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/xbs09/6%e8%80%81%e5%ad%90%e5%9b%9b%e7%ab%a0/%e4%ba%94%e7%9f%b3%e4%b9%8b%e7%93%a0h%c3%b9%e5%ba%84%e5%ad%90","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/xbs09/6%e8%80%81%e5%ad%90%e5%9b%9b%e7%ab%a0/%e4%ba%94%e7%9f%b3%e4%b9%8b%e7%93%a0h%c3%b9%e5%ba%84%e5%ad%90","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/xbs09/6%e8%80%81%e5%ad%90%e5%9b%9b%e7%ab%a0/%e4%ba%94%e7%9f%b3%e4%b9%8b%e7%93%a0h%c3%b9%e5%ba%84%e5%ad%90","title":null}],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":10002,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"5487243dd8d14d65dfadc20ed544a999aaa318fc20c291462ea62c69e1eff320","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-07-30.2","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10002-1","postId":10002,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10002-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10002-2","postId":10002,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-